        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an astronomer  in The Observatory; a short first-person cosmic horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work through the night shift  each week, searching for and capturing images of new planets through a high powered telescope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name and document your discoveries and come to regret your profession, as you soon realize<br>if you stare in to the abyss long enough, it stares back.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836910/extras/03a3b493473b3ae6f0d4eba1f48c7603.poster.avif?t=1787380048\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836910/extras/03a3b493473b3ae6f0d4eba1f48c7603.webm?t=1787380048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836910/extras/03a3b493473b3ae6f0d4eba1f48c7603.mp4?t=1787380048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short Cosmic Horror game inspired by H.P Lovecraft and Junji Ito stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Megalophobia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets and easter eggs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 minutes </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an astronomer  in The Observatory; a short first-person cosmic horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work through the night shift  each week, searching for and capturing images of new planets through a high powered telescope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name and document your discoveries and come to regret your profession, as you soon realize<br>if you stare in to the abyss long enough, it stares back.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836910/extras/03a3b493473b3ae6f0d4eba1f48c7603.poster.avif?t=1787380048\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836910/extras/03a3b493473b3ae6f0d4eba1f48c7603.webm?t=1787380048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836910/extras/03a3b493473b3ae6f0d4eba1f48c7603.mp4?t=1787380048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short Cosmic Horror game inspired by H.P Lovecraft and Junji Ito stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Megalophobia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets and easter eggs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 minutes </p>",
